┃ Hives                                                                                          ┃
┃ The Commons: ranked · active: acme                                                             ┃
┃                                                                                                ┃
┃ Add a hive                                                                                     ┃
┃                                                                                                ┃
┃   name  [lab2]                                                                                 ┃
┃ ▸ hub   [wss://lab2.example.test/contribute]                                                   ┃
┃                                                                                                ┃
┃ Registers with the hub and appends the profile — the registration half of                      ┃
┃ 'just contribute-setup', with no gh login and no backend preflight. The hub                    ┃
┃ URL is the contributor endpoint, e.g. wss://<hive>/contribute.                                 ┃
┃                                                                                                ┃
┃ type to edit  tab next field  enter add  esc cancel                                            ┃
